[0;36m[2026-08-24 19:35:01][0m Committing: "fix(receipts): print/download failed with a 500 — request carried no auth token

The PDF sits behind auth:sanctum and the token is attached by the axios
interceptor, but an iframe src / window.open is a browser navigation and sends
no Authorization header. The request was rejected as unauthenticated, and
Authenticate::redirectTo() then called route('login') — which does not exist on
this API-only backend — so RouteNotFoundException surfaced as a 500 before the
JSON-401 handler could run.

- Add utils/receipt.js: fetch the PDF via axios (token attached), print/save
  from a blob: URL. Replaces three broken call sites, including
  MwanafunziDetail's downloadReceipt which had never worked.
- redirectGuestsTo(null) so an unauthenticated API call returns 401 JSON
- Surface receipt failures in the UI instead of failing silently"
