[0;36m[2026-08-25 13:48:51][0m Committing: "feat(students): split full sponsorship into paid/free, enforce discount amount, cap terms at 4

Sponsorship now has four values. 'full' keeps its exact meaning (fully sponsored,
no payments, no fee, no history, zero invoices); 'full_paid' is new — fully
sponsored but payments are still recorded, so it bills like any other student and
takes a Sponsored Amount that feeds straight into the annual tuition figure.
'half' is unchanged. Enum widening is additive, so no existing row changes.

Discount: selecting a type now requires an amount > 0, an amount requires a type,
and a discount can never exceed the tuition fee.

Payment history: hard cap of 4 terms (an academic year has no more), and the sum
of term fees may not exceed the annual fee.

All of the above are enforced in RegisterStudentRequest, not just the UI, so a
stale page or tampered request cannot bypass them."
