[0;36m[2026-08-25 18:06:01][0m Committing: "fix(auth): parent accounts were created with an unknowable password

resolveGuardian() set bcrypt(Str::random(16)) on every guardian user. That
password was never displayed, stored or sent, and the API has no
forgot/reset-password route, so no parent could ever sign in — 0 of 26 production
parents had must_change_password and none matched any known default.

Guardians now follow the same convention as staff accounts: Hash::make('SCHOOL')
plus must_change_password, so the parent is forced to set their own on first login.

Adds parents:reset-passwords (with --dry-run, --email, --all) to recover the
existing locked-out accounts. It writes only the password and that flag."
