[0;36m[2026-08-25 18:41:15][0m Committing: "fix(parent): implement the fee statement PDF — it was never written

/api/parent/statement/pdf returned 501 for every request. ReportPdf was an empty
stub class, so studentStatement() threw BadMethodCallException, which a bare
catch (\Throwable) converted into 501 'Not Implemented'. The Download Statement
button has never worked.

Implements ReportPdf::studentStatement plus an A4 statement view: school branding,
student and class details, every invoice with term/year/billed/paid/balance and a
status badge, each payment listed beneath its invoice with date, method and
reference, and the running totals.

The catch now logs the real exception and returns 500 rather than 501 — the old
response looked like a deliberate 'not supported yet' and hid the missing method."
