[0;36m[2026-08-27 18:44:34][0m Committing: "fix(invoices): un-clip the invoice dropdown; open receipts in an in-app viewer

The '+N more invoices' menu was clipped by .table-responsive. The previous fix
set overflow-y: visible on that wrapper, which cannot work — per the overflow
spec a 'visible' axis computes to 'auto' whenever the other axis is not visible,
so on a horizontally scrolling table it was silently ignored and no z-index could
help. The menu is now teleported to <body>, outside the clipping container
entirely. Verified: parent is BODY, no clipping ancestor, fully on screen.

Receipts previously fired the browser print dialog blind. Adds
ReceiptViewerModal: the PDF is fetched through axios (so the bearer token is
attached) and shown in the app, with Print, Download and Close, a loading state
and an error state. Scrolls both inside the PDF frame and in the modal body, so
the document stays reachable on short viewports."
