[0;36m[2026-08-27 19:04:00][0m Committing: "fix(receipts): CSP blocked the PDF preview; move documents to A4

The viewer showed 'This content is blocked' on production. The nginx CSP declared
no frame-src, so it fell back to default-src 'self' — and a blob: URL is not
'self'. (img-src already allowed blob:, which is why blob images worked and
frames did not.) Adds frame-src and object-src 'self' blob:. blob: URLs are
minted by this origin's own script and cannot be set remotely; frame-ancestors
'none' still prevents the app being embedded elsewhere.

Receipts and student statements move from A5 to A4, the paper the school prints
on — an A5 page sent to an A4 tray prints as a small block in one corner. The
receipt layout is rescaled for the wider sheet and the letterhead is no longer
rendered in compact mode.

Re-measured the single-page guarantee after the change: the first A4 attempt
overflowed from six fee lines because the larger type and padding ate the extra
height. Spacing trimmed and verified single-page from 1 to 200 lines."
