[0;36m[2026-08-28 03:36:37][0m Committing: "fix(ada-madeni): paginate invoices by student so the page fills

The list renders one row per student (a student's four term invoices collapse
into a single row with a dropdown), but the API paginated invoices. per_page=20
therefore returned 20 invoices that rendered as ~5 rows, leaving the table half
empty while the counter claimed 'showing 1-20'. It also split a student across
a page boundary whenever their invoices straddled one.

InvoiceController@index now accepts group_by_student=1: it paginates distinct
student_ids (ordered by their latest invoice) and returns every invoice for
that page of students, with meta.total counting students. The ungrouped path
is unchanged for other callers. Summary card relabelled to match what it counts."
